msgstr "创建一个账户意味着基于一个 :ref:`secret (seed) phrase <02_decentralchain/01_account:Secret (Seed) Phrase>` 生成一个 :ref:`账户密钥对 <02_decentralchain/01_account:Account Keys>` 和 :ref:`地址 <02_decentralchain/01_account:Address>`."

