msgstr "对 :ref:`交换交易 <02_decentralchain/03_transaction:Exchange Transaction>` 中的订单也进行了类似的检查。"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/03_transaction.rst:1245
#: ../../02_decentralchain/03_transaction.rst:1265
msgid "For the invoke script transaction:"
msgstr "对于引用的脚本交易:"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/03_transaction.rst:1247
